    <h3 class="mb-20">Solar Pump System</h3>

    <p class="mb-20">
        A solar pump system is an efficient and eco-friendly solution for water
        pumping using solar energy. At Shail Solar Energy Solutions  , we provide reliable
        solar water pump systems designed especially for agriculture, irrigation,
        and rural water supply. Solar pumps reduce electricity and diesel costs
        while providing a sustainable and cost-effective water pumping solution.
    </p>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-20">
            <img src="assets/img/service/SolarPumpSystem2.jpg" alt="Solar Pump Installation">
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 mb-20">
            <img src="assets/img/service/SolarPumpSystem3.jpg" alt="Solar Water Pump">
        </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mb-20">
        Our expert team installs high-quality solar pump systems that use solar
        panels to generate electricity and operate water pumps efficiently.
        These systems are ideal for farms, gardens, and remote areas where
        electricity supply is limited. Solar pump systems are durable, require
        minimal maintenance, and help farmers save money while increasing
        agricultural productivity.
    </p>

    <div class="my-4">
        <div class="mb-3">
